# observation groups — a whole (a building's door and wall) inside a family, and thinking on a whole
#
# The haymarket is ringed by houses, each a door and a wall seen from the square. Each house is
# offered as the house, and the houses together as "the surrounding buildings". The area introduction
# names the buildings; directing attention to them renders the houses one by one. Thinking about one
# house offers what both its parts afford — here the wall's climb, pinned with `goal`.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 2 --no-encounters --location-type city --location-id 13582

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60
advance 12 180
expect the surrounding buildings

click keyword buildings
choose 1
choose 0
advance 12 180
expect My attention is drawn to a moss-shouldered cottage
expect hunched lime-washed log cottage

goal scale_up
click keyword cottage
choose 0
choose 0
advance 12 180
expect scale the moss-shouldered cottage wall
quit
